# Dependencies and build artifacts (reinstalled/rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Local env & secrets — never bake into an image
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# VCS, editor, OS noise
.git
.gitignore
**/.DS_Store
.vscode
.idea

# Tests and docs not needed at runtime
**/tests
.project-log
docs
images
*.md
*.pdf
*.pen
